.TH PDFJAM-SLIDES-MORCI 1 "September 2026" "arco-authors" "ARCO authors tools"
.SH NAME
pdfjam-slides-morci \- put eight slides on each PDF sheet
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pdfjam-slides-morci
.I file.pdf
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pdfjam-slides-morci
builds
.I file.2x4.pdf
from
.IR file.pdf ,
for printing slides. The first slide is placed alone and the rest in
framed groups of four; two of those groups go on each portrait A4
sheet, so most sheets hold eight slides. It runs
.BR make (1)
with
.IR /usr/include/arco/pdfjam.mk .
.SH FILES
.I /usr/include/arco/pdfjam.mk
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR arco-pdf-2x1 (1),
.BR pdfjam (1)
